 "description": "Find corroborated illegal spawners or inspect End gateway extraction coverage. kind=illegalSpawner (default) returns only the reviewed subset with explicit pig NBT in a separate hash-verified preserved WDL at the exact NoCom XYZ. It is not a census of all illegal spawners; ordinary/unverified spawners are excluded. kind=endGateway returns zero from the complete block scan. Only Overworld block coverage exists. Optional x/z with radius 1..8192 native blocks; max25/page. Cite canonicalUrl and worldDownloadMetadataUrl; keep capture dates separate from NoCom observation dates. Do not infer current survival or ownership.",
